WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Kneel and place the back foot up on a couch or chair.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Step the front foot forward into a lunge.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Tuck the pelvis and lift the chest.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Optional: reach the same-side arm up.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
